g verification: an agent drives the\ninteraction through any dispatch path while this recorder observes where elements actually\nrender per tick. Duration is clamped below the bridge rpc timeout; chain calls for longer\nwindows.</p>\n","params":[{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"name":"params"},{"type":{"names":["Array.<String>"]},"optional":true,"name":"params.componentIds"},{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>Expands a row&#39;s current child node ids</p>\n","name":"params.cellsOf"},{"type":{"names":["Number"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":2000,"description":"<p>clamped to [100, 8000]</p>\n","name":"params.durationMs"},{"type":{"names":["Number"]},"optional":true,"defaultvalue":100,"description":"<p>clamped to [16, 1000]</p>\n","name":"params.intervalMs"},{"type":{"names":["Array.<String>"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>Raw DOM element ids to sample</p>\n","name":"params.nodeIds"},{"type":{"names":["String"]},"optional":true,"description":"<p>Required for deterministic node-only multi-window sampling</p>\n","name":"params.windowId"}],"returns":[{"type":{"names":["Object"]},"description":"{componentIds, nodeIds, targetIds, samples: [{t, rects}]}"}],"name":"observeMotion","longname":"ComponentService#observeMotion","kind":"function","memberof":"ComponentService","scope":"instance","async":true,"$longname":"ComponentService#observeMotion","$kind":"method","id":2618,"neoClassName":"Neo.ai.client.ComponentService"},{"comment":"/**\n     * Compares a container's three child-order surfaces — logical items, vdom child nodes,\n     * and the rendered DOM — and reports mismatches (count, order, membership, duplicates).\n     * The duplication detector: a column/item existing twice is a surface disagreement.\n     * A vdom node stamped `removeDom` is withheld from the DOM by contract (a withdrawn\n     * focus-gated action, a `removeDom`-hidden child), so the DOM is expected to lack it.\n     * @param {Object} params\n     * @param {String} para